From 6e1a9d0e5b1fa87e3ed893b75e8602627e770569 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dominggoes Isakh <drjisakh@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 05:16:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] Android.bp: import the hardware/google/pixel/usb
 namespace

hardware/google/pixel/usb/Android.bp declares its own soong_namespace
(importing hardware/google/pixel/pixelstats), separate from the
top-level hardware/google/pixel one. This device's
android.hardware.usb.gadget-service.samsung depends on
libpixelusb-aidl, which lives in that nested namespace, so without
importing it Soong fails analysis with 'depends on undefined module'
even though the module exists -- it's just not visible from this
namespace's import list.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: Ic64a5c2b79aef7058d3d3a2fac45e8de82df2c22
---
 Android.bp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 869896a..c95ae2c 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 soong_namespace {
     imports: [
         "hardware/google/pixel",
+        "hardware/google/pixel/usb",
         "hardware/google/interfaces",
     ],
 }
